---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title={"Mutual · Paramore.Design"}
  description={"Ten years as the sole founding designer of Mutual, the #1 LDS dating app, responsible for 40,000+ marriages and counting."}
>
<!-- Project Hero -->
  <section class="project-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <a href="/work" class="btn btn--ghost" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-xl); display: inline-flex;">
        <span style="margin-right: var(--space-sm);">&larr;</span> All Projects
      </a>
      <span class="label project-hero__label" style="display: block;">Founder · Director of UI/UX · Solo Designer</span>
      <h1 class="display-lg project-hero__title">Mutual</h1>
      <div class="project-hero__meta">
        <div class="project-hero__meta-item">
          <span class="project-hero__meta-label">Role</span>
          <span class="project-hero__meta-value">Co-Founder · Sole Founding Designer</span>
        </div>
        <div class="project-hero__meta-item">
          <span class="project-hero__meta-label">Timeline</span>
          <span class="project-hero__meta-value">2015 – 2026 · Ten Years</span>
        </div>
        <div class="project-hero__meta-item">
          <span class="project-hero__meta-label">Platform</span>
          <span class="project-hero__meta-value">iOS, Android, Web</span>
        </div>
        <div class="project-hero__meta-item">
          <span class="project-hero__meta-label">Scope</span>
          <span class="project-hero__meta-value">Product, Brand, UI, Research</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Hero Image, wide 2:1 marquee -->
  <div class="container">
    <div class="image-solo" style="max-width: 1100px;">
      <div class="image-frame" style="aspect-ratio: 2564 / 1275;">
        <img src="/assets/projects/mutual/MutualHero-wide.jpg" alt="Mutual, case study hero composition">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Intro -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container project-content">
      <h2>Ten years. One designer.</h2>
      <p>
        Co-founder and sole founding designer of Mutual, the #1 LDS dating app in the world.
        Grew it from a scrappy startup into a multi-million-dollar business. Part-time from
        day one, full-time since 2021.
      </p>
      <p>
        Ten years as the only designer in the company. Owned every surface end-to-end: UI,
        product and user research, design system, brand identity. Greatly involved in product
        direction, strategy, and success.
      </p>
      <p>
        Responsible for 40,000+ marriages and counting. Humbling, and fills me with joy.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Stats -->
  <section class="section--sm">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="stats">
        <div class="stat">
          <div class="stat__value">10 yrs</div>
          <div class="stat__label">Sole founding designer, end-to-end ownership.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <div class="stat__value">40k+</div>
          <div class="stat__label">Marriages from Mutual users, and counting.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <div class="stat__value">#1</div>
          <div class="stat__label">LDS dating app worldwide.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- The Wall: 18-month gallery -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="gallery-intro">
        <h2>Concept <span class="accent">to</span> Ship.</h2>
        <p>
          A slice of the last year and a half of work at Mutual, feature concepts, A/B tests,
          prototypes, and shipped releases. <strong>Each thumbnail represents a complete Figma page</strong>
          behind it: dev-ready flows, design system updates, and the supporting work that made
          it real.
        </p>
        <p>
          Most shipped. Some are still v1s waiting on a v2. A few stayed prototypes that didn't
          make it past testing. Each one started as an idea I shaped into something concrete
          enough to put in front of people and talk about.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mutual-grid" id="mutualGrid"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Closing -->
  <section class="closing">
    <div class="container container--narrow">
      <h2>And that's <span class="accent">just</span> the last 18 months.</h2>
      <p>
        Ten years of this, every login screen, empty state, paywall, illustration, A/B test,
        and brand refresh. If you're curious about any of it, I'd love to talk.
      </p>
      <div style="display: inline-flex; gap: var(--space-md); flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center;">
        <a href="mailto:hparamore@gmail.com" class="btn btn--primary">
          Email Me <span class="btn__arrow">&rarr;</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/work" class="btn btn--secondary">More Work</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Next Project -->
  <section class="section" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);">
    <div class="container" style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
      <span class="label">Next Project</span>
      <a href="/projects/the-tree-service" class="btn btn--ghost" style="font-size: var(--text-xl);">
        The Tree Service <span class="btn__arrow">&rarr;</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Footer -->

<Fragment slot="after-footer">
<!-- Lightbox modal -->
  <div class="lightbox" id="lightbox">
    <img alt="" id="lightboxImg">
    <span class="lightbox__close">[ esc to close ]</span>
    <span class="lightbox__caption" id="lightboxCaption"></span>
  </div>

  

  <script>
    // ============================================================
    //   Mutual gallery, auto-generates grid from filename list
    //   To add/remove a card, edit this array.
    // ============================================================
    const cards = [
      '01-Plan Cards - L.webp',
      '02-Paywall Liked Profiles - L.webp',
      '03-Promo Link - L.webp',
      '04-Free Notes - L.webp',
      '05-Who Sees You - L.webp',
      '06-Distance Update - L.webp',
      '07-PhotoLikeRate.webp',
      '08-Plan Selection Paywall - L.webp',
      '09-Note Update - L.webp',
      '10-Gold Notes - L.webp',
      '11-NewLikedYou.webp',
      '12-Distance Update - L.webp',
      '13-Free Notes - L.webp',
      '14-Match Controls on Liked Profile - L.webp',
      '15-Like History - L.webp',
      '16-Interest Search - L.webp',
      '17-Interest Sub Preview - L.webp',
      '18-Free Daily Like Reveal - L.webp',
      '19-Resubscribe Discount - L.webp',
      '20-Its Mutual Update - L.webp',
      '21-Chat Threads Update - L.webp',
      '22-PinConvo.webp',
      '23-Gold Notes - L.webp',
      '24-Undo Toast - L.webp',
      '25-Manage Subscription - L.webp',
      '26-Quick Message - L.webp',
      '27-Premium Rebrand - L.webp',
      '28-Common Ground - L.webp',
      '29-Icebreakers - L.webp',
      '30-AI Conversation Topics - L.webp',
      '31-MassDismiss.webp',
      '32-Match Introduction - L.webp',
      '33-Voice Messaging - L.webp',
      '34-Chat Interactions  - L.webp',
      '35-Mutual Intro - L.webp',
      '36-Prompts in Potentials - L.webp',
      '37-Rate Us.webp',
      '38-Pandemic Pricing - L.webp',
      '39-Talk about their Profile - L.webp',
      '40-Liked Context in Chat - L.webp',
      '41-New Note and Like View - L.webp',
      '42-NewVerificationImage.webp',
      '43-Profile Prompt Update - L.webp',
      '44-Updated Legacy Pricing - L.webp',
      '45-Paywall Update 2025 - L.webp',
      '46-App Icons - L.webp',
      '47-Note View in Chat - L.webp',
      '48-Boost - L.webp',
      '49-Ark Paywall Discount - L.webp',
      '50-New Subscription Menu - L.webp',
      '51-Updated Empty Chat - L.webp',
      '52-NewDelete.webp',
      '53-Updated Profile.webp',
      '54-NewBirthdayPicker.webp',
      '55-Helpful Note Hints - L.webp',
      '56-GoldNoteHelper.webp',
      '57-NewLogin.webp',
      '58-Free Liked You - L.webp',
      '59-Interests - L.webp',
      '60-Permissions Update.webp',
      '61-FasterAccountCreation.webp',
      '62-Notes and Likes Tab - L.webp',
      '63-FreeBoost.webp',
      '64-NewAccountReview.webp',
      '65-MutualPromoLink.webp',
      '66-2025 debrief.webp',
      '67-NewProfiles.webp',
      '68-NewSpeedHome.webp'
    ];

    // Convert filename to a clean human-readable title
    function titleFromFile(f) {
      return f
        .replace(/^\d+-/, '')              // strip leading "12-"
        .replace(/\s*-\s*L\.png$/i, '')    // strip " - L.png"
        .replace(/\.png$/i, '')            // strip ".png"
        // Insert spaces before capitals in CamelCase like "NewLikedYou"
        .replace(/([a-z])([A-Z])/g, '$1 $2')
        .replace(/([A-Z]+)([A-Z][a-z])/g, '$1 $2')
        .trim();
    }

    // Populate the grid
    const grid = document.getElementById('mutualGrid');
    cards.forEach((file) => {
      const title = titleFromFile(file);
      const src = '/assets/projects/mutual/' + encodeURIComponent(file);
      const cardEl = document.createElement('div');
      cardEl.className = 'mutual-card';
      cardEl.innerHTML =
        `<img src="${src}" alt="${title}" loading="lazy">` +
        `<span class="mutual-card__title">${title}</span>`;
      cardEl.addEventListener('click', () => openLightbox(src, title));
      grid.appendChild(cardEl);
    });

    // ============================================================
    //   Lightbox
    // ============================================================
    const lightbox = document.getElementById('lightbox');
    const lightboxImg = document.getElementById('lightboxImg');
    const lightboxCaption = document.getElementById('lightboxCaption');

    function openLightbox(src, caption) {
      lightboxImg.src = src;
      lightboxImg.alt = caption;
      lightboxCaption.textContent = caption;
      lightbox.classList.add('open');
      document.body.style.overflow = 'hidden';
    }
    function closeLightbox() {
      lightbox.classList.remove('open');
      document.body.style.overflow = '';
      // Clear src after the close transition so the next open is clean
      setTimeout(() => { lightboxImg.src = ''; }, 200);
    }
    lightbox.addEventListener('click', closeLightbox);
    document.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
      if (e.key === 'Escape' && lightbox.classList.contains('open')) closeLightbox();
    });
  </script>
</Fragment>
</Base>

<style is:global>
    /* ---------- Square hero image frame ---------- */
    .image-frame {
      aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
      background: var(--color-surface-elevated);
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      overflow: hidden;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: var(--color-text-muted);
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: var(--text-xl);
      letter-spacing: var(--tracking-display);
      text-align: center;
      padding: var(--space-md);
    }
    .image-frame img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      display: block;
    }
    .image-solo {
      max-width: 720px;
      margin: var(--space-3xl) auto var(--space-md);
    }

    /* ---------- Stats strip (same pattern as Tree Service) ---------- */
    .stats {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: var(--space-2xl);
      padding: var(--space-2xl) 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
      margin: var(--space-2xl) 0;
    }
    .stat__value {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: var(--text-5xl);
      line-height: 0.95;
      color: var(--color-accent);
      letter-spacing: var(--tracking-display);
      margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
    }
    .stat__label {
      font-size: var(--text-sm);
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
      line-height: 1.4;
      max-width: 22ch;
    }
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .stats { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: var(--space-xl); }
    }

    /* ---------- Section title for the gallery wall ---------- */
    .gallery-intro {
      margin: var(--space-3xl) 0 var(--space-2xl);
    }
    .gallery-intro h2 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: var(--text-4xl);
      line-height: 0.95;
      letter-spacing: var(--tracking-display);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
      max-width: 22ch;
    }
    .gallery-intro h2 .accent { color: var(--color-accent); }
    .gallery-intro p {
      font-size: var(--text-md);
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
      max-width: 70ch;
      margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
    }
    .gallery-intro p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

    /* ---------- The wall: 68-card grid ---------- */
    .mutual-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: var(--space-md);
      margin-bottom: var(--space-3xl);
    }
    .mutual-card {
      aspect-ratio: 612 / 862;
      overflow: hidden;
      cursor: zoom-in;
      transition: transform 0.25s var(--ease-out);
      position: relative;
    }
    .mutual-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-3px);
    }
    .mutual-card img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      display: block;
      transition: transform 0.4s var(--ease-out);
    }
    .mutual-card:hover img {
      transform: scale(1.02);
    }
    @media (max-width: 1024px) {
      .mutual-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
    }
    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .mutual-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: var(--space-sm); }
    }

    /* Optional caption shown below each card with a quick hover state */
    .mutual-card__title {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      padding: var(--space-sm) var(--space-md);
      background: linear-gradient(transparent, rgba(0,0,0,0.85));
      color: #fff;
      font-size: var(--text-xs);
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(8px);
      transition: opacity 0.2s var(--ease-out), transform 0.2s var(--ease-out);
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .mutual-card:hover .mutual-card__title {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }

    /* ---------- Lightbox (click any thumbnail to zoom) ---------- */
    .lightbox {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.94);
      z-index: 1000;
      display: none;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 32px;
      cursor: zoom-out;
      opacity: 0;
      transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
    }
    .lightbox.open {
      display: flex;
      opacity: 1;
    }
    .lightbox img {
      max-width: 100%;
      max-height: 100%;
      object-fit: contain;
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 30px 80px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
    }
    .lightbox__close {
      position: absolute;
      top: 24px;
      right: 32px;
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: var(--text-xl);
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      cursor: pointer;
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .lightbox__caption {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 24px;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
      font-size: var(--text-sm);
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      text-align: center;
      max-width: 80vw;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    /* ---------- Closing CTA ---------- */
    .closing {
      text-align: center;
      padding: var(--space-3xl) 0;
    }
    .closing h2 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: var(--text-4xl);
      line-height: 0.95;
      letter-spacing: var(--tracking-display);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      max-width: 22ch;
      margin: 0 auto var(--space-md);
    }
    .closing h2 .accent { color: var(--color-accent); }
    .closing p {
      max-width: 50ch;
      margin: 0 auto var(--space-xl);
      font-size: var(--text-lg);
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    }
  </style>
